    "readme_excerpt": "# GhostB 🏆\nBroke To Boss is a web platform designed to help minority groups and the general public improve their financial literacy. This platform features an AI-powered chatbot, multilingual support, and structured financial courses to increase user engagement and improve financial education worldwide.\n## Features 🚀\n- **Financial Literacy Courses**\n- **AI Chatbot**\n- **Multilingual Support**\n- **User Progress Tracking**\n- **Fast and Responsive**\n## Tech Stack 🏗️\n- **Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript**\n- **Backend: Node.js, Express.js, MySQL, Google Gemini API**\n## Visual 📸\n## Installation 🔧\n1. Create a codespace within GitHub\n2. Type \"npm install\"\n3. Then type \"npm start\"\n4. Then type localhost:3000 on your browser",
